---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在">
  <section class="not-found glass-card">
    <p class="not-found-code">404</p>
    <h1>这一页暂时不在这里</h1>
    <p>可能是地址写错了，或者文章已经搬到了别处。</p>
    <div>
      <a class="primary-action" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a href="/archives/">查看归档</a>
      <a href="/search/">搜索文章</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
